\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Multiscale $K$-scale diagnostics.} (a) Continuous 2D heatmap of local dimension $\langle d \rangle $ across proper time $\tau $ and neighborhood size $K$, alongside the fitted collapse threshold $\tau ^*(K) \approx a \cdot K^b$. (b) Trajectory dimension curves $\langle d_{\mathrm  {PR}} \rangle $ across scale pairs $(K, 2K)$ with $\pm 1\sigma $ uncertainty bands, demonstrating that scale sensitivity $|\Delta d| \to 0$ vanishes near $K_{\mathrm  {opt}} \approx 100$.}}{9}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:multiscale_diagnostics}{{3}{9}{\textbf {Multiscale $K$-scale diagnostics.} (a) Continuous 2D heatmap of local dimension $\langle d \rangle $ across proper time $\tau $ and neighborhood size $K$, alongside the fitted collapse threshold $\tau ^*(K) \approx a \cdot K^b$. (b) Trajectory dimension curves $\langle d_{\mathrm {PR}} \rangle $ across scale pairs $(K, 2K)$ with $\pm 1\sigma $ uncertainty bands, demonstrating that scale sensitivity $|\Delta d| \to 0$ vanishes near $K_{\mathrm {opt}} \approx 100$}{figure.caption.6}{}}
